# Free variables z,w default to complex; re/im/abs/arg infer as complex (WRONG).
show z + 1
show w * z
show re(z)
show im(w + z)
show conj(z) * z
show z * conj(z)
show z + x
show abs(z)
show re(3 + 4i)
show im(3 + 4i)
show abs(3 + 4i)
show conj(3 + 4i)
show |3 + 4i|
show real(3 + 4i)
show modulus(3 + 4i)
show re(z: complex)
show im(z: complex)
show abs(z: complex)
show arg(z: complex)
show real(z: complex)
